# Normalise to LF on checkout everywhere. This project builds and runs in
# Linux containers: CRLF in the Dockerfile would break the backslash line
# continuations in its RUN steps, and CRLF in docker-compose.yml commands or
# the mounted Python sources causes the same class of "works on my machine"
# failure after a clone on Windows.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Never let Git rewrite bytes in credentials or binaries.
secrets/* -text
*.png binary
*.pdf binary
